SpaceWorks-Organization continues Aarannu, a community digital ID platform by
Shaan Shoukath.

Parts of the platform layer and the ID-card engine are derived from
SpaceWorks-Events (https://github.com/SpaceWorks-HQ/SpaceWorks-Events, AGPL-3.0-or-later),
forked at commit 03186e0. SpaceWorks-Events grew from Yuyu
(https://github.com/twilighty-abhi/yuyu) by Abhiram N J, which also inspired
Space Works UX.

The Space Works name, logo and visual identity come from the Space Works
design system (https://github.com/SpaceWorks-HQ/SpaceWorks-Design).

Member cards fall back to Noto Sans, Noto Sans Malayalam and Noto Sans Devanagari
(public/fonts/noto, from the Fontsource 5.3.0 packages) for characters the brand
font lacks. Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors, licensed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 (public/fonts/noto/OFL.txt).
